                        <p>
                            The certified management accountancy course or Cma USA course is quite popular in the financial space amongst professionals due to its rich reputation and authenticity. CMA USA is granted by IMA (Institute of Management Accountants, USA). The IMA (Institute of Management Accountants, USA) is a globally recognized body and is known for providing this global qualification across borders.

                        </p>
                        <p>
                            The Certified Management Accountant (CMA) exam is structurally divided into two parts and each part is organized to focus on different information coordinates altogether. The entire subjects of CMA Course, inclusive of each portion of Part 1 and part 2 measure student’s knowledge and competence objectively in the management accounting field. All students who enroll for this prestigious course are expected to gain deep familiarity with the entire CMA USA syllabus. The syllabus is strategically divided too-

                        </p>

