                        <h3 class="sub-head">Quick tips to cover CMA Part 1 successfully in your preparation journey-


                        </h3>
                        <ul class="about__info-list list-wrap">

                            <li class="about__info-list-item">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>Make a study schedule and divide your available study hours through careful evaluation.



                            </li>
                            <li class="about__info-list-item">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>Planning, Budgeting, and Forecasting - 20%


                            </li>
                            <li class="about__info-list-item">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>Generate a weekly timeline and keep a track of all your activities to help avoid time drainage.


                            </li>
                            <li class="about__info-list-item">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>Plan out your activities and weed out any unproductive hour.



                            </li>
                            <li class="about__info-list-item">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>Once you have your study plan sorted, pick a few short study sessions, to begin with, and gradually extend them to longer study sessions.

                            </li>
                            <li class="about__info-list-item">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>Do not forget to consider your convenience and never ignore resting breaks. This would help you stay alert and comfortable during your preparation journey.


                            </li>
                            <li class="about__info-list-item">
